---@field createTime? string Output only. The creation timestamp of the exclusion.This field may not be present for older exclusions.
---@field description? string Optional. A description of this exclusion.
---@field parent string Required. The parent resource in which to create the exclusion: "projects/[PROJECT_ID]" "organizations/[ORGANIZATION_ID]" "billingAccounts/[BILLING_ACCOUNT_ID]" "folders/[FOLDER_ID]" For examples:"projects/my-logging-project" "organizations/123456789"

