---@field bucketId? string Required. A client-assigned identifier such as "my-bucket". Identifiers are limited to 100 characters and can include only letters, digits, underscores, hyphens, and periods. Bucket identifiers must start with an alphanumeric character.

---@class gcp.logging_v2.CreateLocationsBucketsViewsRequest
