---@field parent string Required. The parent resource in which to create the saved query: "projects/[PROJECT_ID]/locations/[LOCATION_ID]" "organizations/[ORGANIZATION_ID]/locations/[LOCATION_ID]" "billingAccounts/[BILLING_ACCOUNT_ID]/locations/[LOCATION_ID]" "folders/[FOLDER_ID]/locations/[LOCATION_ID]" For example: "projects/my-project/locations/global" "organizations/123456789/locations/us-central1"
