---@class gcp.logging_v2.DefaultSinkConfig
---@field filter? string Optional. An advanced logs filter (https://docs.cloud.google.com/logging/docs/view/building-queries#queries-by-expression). The only exported log entries are those that are in the resource owning the sink and that match the filter.For example:logName="projects/[PROJECT_ID]/logs/[LOG_ID]" AND severity>=ERRORTo match all logs, don't add exclusions and use the following line as the value of filter:logName:*Cannot be empty or unset when the value of mode is OVERWRITE.
